    "# 📈 Stock Market Prediction and Trading Signal System\n",
    "\n",
    "This project builds a machine learning system that analyzes historical stock market data and generates **Buy/Sell trading signals** using technical indicators and predictive models.\n",
    "\n",
    "The system uses financial indicators such as **Moving Averages, RSI, MACD, and Bollinger Bands** to train machine learning models that predict market movement.\n",
    "\n",
    "The project also includes **model evaluation, backtesting, and visualization** to analyze trading performance.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Problem Statement\n",
    "\n",
    "Predicting stock market movement is a challenging problem due to market volatility and complex financial dynamics.\n",
    "\n",
    "The objective of this project is to build a **data-driven trading model** that:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Analyzes historical stock data\n",
    "- Generates technical indicators\n",
    "- Predicts whether the stock price will **increase or decrease the next day**\n",
    "- Produces **Buy/Sell trading signals**"
   ]
  },
